  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム NT』の主役MSナラティブガンダムが超大型装備で登場！",
      "en": "Mobile Suit Gundam NT's main character MS Narrative Gundam appears in super large equipment!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 超大型武装「A装備」を外した素体状態も再現可能。",
      "en": "• It is also possible to reproduce the body state without the super large weapon \"A equipment\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 胸部の展開ギミックにより、ダイナミックなアクションにも対応。",
      "en": "• The expansion gimmick on the chest allows for dynamic actions."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 股関節の軸にはスイング機構を採用し、脚部の広範囲可動を実現。",
      "en": "• A swing mechanism is used for the hip joint axis, allowing a wide range of leg movement."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 大ボリュームのプロペラントタンクを再現。",
      "en": "• Reproduces a large volume propellant tank."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ミサイルポッドのハッチ内にミサイルディテールを再現。",
      "en": "• Missile details are reproduced inside the hatch of the missile pod."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 大型装備を支持するスタンドが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with a stand to support large equipment."
    }
  ],
